This is a modified version, OpenH1's fork
(https://github.com/OpenH1/opence-master-server), which runs the GOAT H1
master.

Modified on 2026-11-10 by the OpenH1 contributors: the game's name in the
pages', the Discord bot's, the mails' and the help's text is a setting
(MASTER_GAME_NAME, default "OpenCE"), and the pages' footer links the
source of the version running (MASTER_PROJECT_URL). The protocol, the
stored data and their names are upstream's, unchanged.
